ETo </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">10</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br></span><span style=\"color:#800\">## interpret effect of changing Silt by 100 units</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>SEM</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df$Silt_100 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> SEM</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">df$Silt </span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">100</span></div></code></div><div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><div style=\"font-size:13px\">Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div style=\"font-size:13px\">Postdoctoral Researcher, Methods and Statistics</div><div style=\"font-size:13px\">Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div style=\"font-size:13px\"><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792424789259000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3os7oUGzmJyEpo42YrZAmv\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div><div><br></div></div></div><div><br></div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
